Rep127ModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Builds a list of n repetitions of byte 127 (0x7F). Used for padding the WASM code section to alignment.
    Provides: Rep127(n) -> res. n — Int (repeat count); returns a list of n bytes 127.
    DependsOn: none (leaf; Core.List/ListPush/Sub/Gt, Loop).
    Composition: Native Include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir (Path: ../Rep127/Rep127.sir).
    Notes: 0x7F — valid WASM padding byte ("else"/nop opcode); applied in GenWasm when forming the code section.
